\x1b[94m# Code spans\x1b[m

A double-backtick span \x1b[91m``with a ` inside``\x1b[m and one that wraps \x1b[91m``across\x1b[m
\x1b[91mthe line break``\x1b[m before more prose.

A triple-backtick span \x1b[91m```wraps\x1b[m
\x1b[91mtoo```\x1b[m and a single one \x1b[91m`also\x1b[m
\x1b[91mwraps`\x1b[m.

An unterminated \x1b[91m``span stops at the blank line\x1b[m

so this paragraph is prose again.

